Protocol knowledge
------------------
The status codes, their scales and the command semantics of the Danfoss Ally
API (setpoints in tenths of a degree, external sensor in hundredths, the
`last_click_time` of a mode change, the "radiator covered" commands, the 500
answer of /status on some models) come from pydanfossally 1.3.0 by Malene
Trab and contributors (https://github.com/MTrab/pydanfossally), its
parser and its "writable properties research" note. Its package metadata
declares the MIT License, while its repository ships a GPL-3.0 LICENSE file.
No code was copied from it: this integration is an independent JavaScript
implementation of the same API facts. No code was taken from the Home
Assistant "danfoss_ally" component either.
